  "usage": [
    "嚟 is a verb that means 'to come' in Cantonese.",
    "It is often used to indicate movement towards the speaker or the current place.",
    "嚟 can be used alone or combined with other verbs and particles to indicate direction or intention.",
    "In questions, 嚟 is used to ask if someone is coming or to confirm arrival.",
    "It can also be used to attract someone's attention, similar to 'come here' in English."
